recommend keep-going confer_words leads the free head at 294 over forty-three rungs of a ten-line body, priced at forty-three import re-exports the arc has measured as free; reclaim_notes stands at the same fall costing nothing of any kind, so the honest lift is reclaim_notes and the queue now shows why without a hand weighing it. Beside the arc, REDS %147 leaves a real question worth its own round: how many other standing guards have drifted, and whether the standing-equipment habit wants a meter that reports when each one last ran.
